application  choupoSolve;
tier         tutorial;
description  "Ammonia synthesis loop with a THREE-BED QUENCH CONVERTER: cold feed gas is taken off upstream of the feed-effluent exchanger and injected between adiabatic catalyst beds, so the gas zigzags about the locus of maximum rate instead of riding one adiabatic line to a single hot equilibrium. Same loop as ammonia02 (200 bar, 3:1 makeup, 3% purge, Henry-law dissolved gases); the converter is the redesign. The quench split is the design variable.";
verbosity    3;
